This desolate hall is nearly empty, save for a few long benches which are scattered throughout the room. The walls seem to be scorched, and everywhere are signs of decay. A sickening odor pervades the room, and wisps of acrid black smoke can be seen to the north. A wide passage leads south, and a small one opens to the east.
To the north you can hear the sound of a group of low, guttural voices.
The low, guttural voices seem to be coming in your direction.

